        Middleby family, with Middleby corporate distribution backing the Pitco parts pipeline. We service Pitco
        fryers alongside Blodgett ovens, Southbend ranges, Imperial cooking equipment, and other Middleby family
        brands on the same service account — one call, one visit, one invoice across multiple equipment
        categories within the Middleby family. For LA kitchens running mixed Middleby + Ali Group + ITW + Welbilt
        installs (the typical real-world commercial kitchen), we maintain parts pipelines and service expertise
        across all the major corporate families, not just one.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

